Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 19:23:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show actives on leaderboard and sort by last played first

- Add Actives column to weekly leaderboard table (desktop and mobile)
- Move Last played to the first data column after learner name
- Sort leaderboard entries by most recent last played date, then actives
  and other tie-breakers for weekly; monthly uses last played then points
---
 src/app/api/leaderboard/public/route.ts   | 29 +++++-----
 src/app/leaderboard/LeaderboardClient.tsx | 66 +++++++++++++++--------
 2 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 36 deletions(-)

